From dc6dc9d5182c995be1a0553527d791a04ad23f02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek <abhishek01789@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:09:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/41] Stack windows in tile columns (Super+Comma /
 Super+Period)

A column can hold several windows that split its height evenly.
Super+Comma stacks the focused window into the column on its left,
Super+Period pops it back out, Super+Up/Down moves focus inside a
column. Alt copies exist for the preview inside KDE.
